          "Use one or two font families at most. Avoid thin scripts and hairline serifs for long titles, because the thin strokes disappear at small sizes. Place the title on a quiet area, such as sky, a flat color band or a dark corner. Keep the subtitle short and much smaller, or move it to the product description.",
