          "Ask for first name and email only. Every extra field is another reason to close the tab.",
          "Name the file after the promise. Nobody can find final_v3.pdf in a downloads folder a week later.",
          "Compress the images so the PDF opens quickly on a phone with a weak signal.",
          "Go through the thank-you page as a stranger would. It should say where the file went and offer the next step right away."
