    "slug": "how-much-does-a-memoir-ghostwriter-cost",
    "title": "How Much Does a Memoir Ghostwriter Cost? (US Author Guide)",
    "description": "How much does a memoir ghostwriter cost? EFA and Reedsy benchmarks, what moves memoir quotes up or down, and how scoped packages compare to trade memoirs.",
    "date": "2026-10-10",
    "dateLabel": "October 10, 2026",
    "readTime": "12 min read",
