          "If you're in the U.S., the official place to buy is Bowker, through its MyIdentifiers site. As of October 2026 the list price is $125 for one ISBN or $295 for a block of 10. That's $29.50 apiece. Bowker ISBNs never expire, and they list you, or your company, as the publisher.",
