          "Our [KDP publishing checklist for first-time authors](/blog/kdp-publishing-checklist-for-first-time-authors) shows where this page fits in a launch, and our guide on [how to format an ebook for Amazon KDP](/blog/how-to-format-an-ebook-for-amazon-kdp) covers building the front matter. Still at the manuscript stage? Start with our step-by-step guide on [how to write an ebook](/blog/how-to-write-an-ebook). And if you'd rather hand production off, our [Amazon KDP ebook writing service](/amazon-kdp-ebook-writing) covers the manuscript, EPUB and print files, category and keyword research, and guided setup on a KDP account you own."
