    "lead": "KDP royalties for Kindle ebooks come in two options, 35% and 70%, and you pick one for each book on the pricing screen. On Amazon.com the 70% option pays 70% of the list price minus a delivery cost of $0.15 per MB, and only for ebooks priced from $2.99 to $12.99. The 35% option pays 35% of the list price with no delivery cost. Paperbacks and Kindle Unlimited work differently. The figures below follow Amazon's KDP help pages as of late 2026.",
