          "If your book is image heavy, compress the images before conversion and then compare both options on the pricing step. The pricing tab works as a royalty calculator and shows the estimated royalty for each option at any price you enter. Our guide on [how to format an ebook for Amazon KDP](/blog/how-to-format-an-ebook-for-amazon-kdp) covers keeping image files lean."
