          "Here is a worked example with illustrative numbers, not benchmarks. At 2,000 visitors a month and a 3% opt-in rate, you gain 60 subscribers a month. If 2% of them become clients at an average engagement of $2,000, that is about $2,400 a month in pipeline traced to one asset. Replace these figures with your own.",
          "The same chain shows why the quality of the guide matters. Any improvement in the opt-in rate multiplies through every month of traffic you send to the page.",
