          "**Per word** is our favorite for comparing, because the math's so easy. Published rate charts put professional nonfiction ghostwriting at somewhere around $0.33 to $1.00 a word, and memoir or technical stuff tends to sit near the top. Here's the napkin version we do on calls. Thirty thousand words at fifty cents is $15,000 of pure writing time, so if someone quotes you a tenth of that, it's worth asking what they're skipping.",
