    "lead": "This KDP publishing checklist takes you from a finished manuscript to a live Amazon listing, in the order KDP asks for things. Amazon KDP is self-serve, which makes it accessible, but it is unforgiving of missing pieces. If you upload before the text is final, you spend your launch on a book you will re-upload next week. If you rush the metadata, the book lands in a category nobody searches. Work the eight stages below in order, tick every line, and leave the publish button for last.",
