          "Formatting is its own craft: a working table of contents, clean chapter starts, and fonts and spacing that behave on every device. The full walkthrough is in [how to format an ebook for Amazon KDP](/blog/how-to-format-an-ebook-for-amazon-kdp). If you would rather hand it off, every package on our [pricing](/pricing) page includes editing, a cover, and EPUB and PDF files."
